ass sie sofort eingeschlafen war, hatte sie die Bewerbungsunterlagen zusammengestellt, damit der Personalchef einen guten Eindruck bekommt. Eines Tages möchte sie ihre eigene Firma gründen. Der Kollege, von dem sie viel gelernt hatte, unterstützte sie dabei. Am Abend wird das größte Feedback des Tages kommen: der Makler wird ihnen sagen, ob die Wohnung ihnen gehört.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Der lange Samstag","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b1-19-goethe-halbzeit-test","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Uta, könntest du mal über mein Bewerbungsschreiben schauen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_019_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-19-goethe-halbzeit-test","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Klar, zeig mal her ...","speaker":"Uta","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_019_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-19-goethe-halbzeit-test","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Hm, der erste Satz ist ein bisschen zu förmlich.","speaker":"Uta","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B1_019_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-19-goethe-halbzeit-test","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Wirklich?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_019_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-19-goethe-halbzeit-test","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Ich dachte, das klingt professionell.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B1_019_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b1-19-goethe-halbzeit-test","level":"B1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Es klingt eher distanziert.","speaker":"Uta","voiceRole":"female